{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization, cache keys, and the existing tests, then fix the isolation bugs and verify the behavior.\n\nProject detail reads lack a membership check, list keys omit the organization, and updates invalidate only detail entries. I’ll add the ownership check and organization-scoped list invalidation, while preserving authorization before cache access.\n\nFixed ownership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected list variants without clearing other organizations’ caches. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","final_output":"Fixed ownership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected list variants without clearing other organizations’ caches. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":8,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/tenant-cache-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":209,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-66ea676681e1e94117b9972a54fab513.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"w